<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>set on Open Component Model</title><link>https://ocm.software/legacy/docs/reference/ocm-cli/set/</link><description>Recent content in set on Open Component Model</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><atom:link href="https://ocm.software/legacy/docs/reference/ocm-cli/set/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>pubsub</title><link>https://ocm.software/legacy/docs/reference/ocm-cli/set/pubsub/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ocm.software/legacy/docs/reference/ocm-cli/set/pubsub/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="usage"&gt;Usage&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="expressive-code"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;figure class="frame not-content"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;figcaption class="header"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;span class="title"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;ocm set pubsub {&amp;lt;ocm repository&amp;gt;} [&amp;lt;pub/sub specification&amp;gt;]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;h3 id="options"&gt;Options&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="expressive-code"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;figure class="frame not-content"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;figcaption class="header"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;span class="title"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt; -d, --delete delete pub/sub configuration&#10; -h, --help help for pubsub&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;h3 id="description"&gt;Description&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;A repository may be able to store a publish/subscribe specification&#10;to propagate the creation or update of component versions.&#10;If such an implementation is available this command can be used&#10;to set the pub/sub specification for a repository.&#10;If no specification is given an existing specification&#10;will be removed for the given repository.&#10;The specification&#10;can be queried with the &lt;a href="https://ocm.software/legacy/docs/reference/ocm-cli/get/pubsub/"&gt;ocm get pubsub&lt;/a&gt;.&#10;Types and specification formats are shown for the topic&#10;&lt;a href="https://ocm.software/legacy/docs/reference/ocm-cli/help/ocm-pubsub/"&gt;ocm ocm-pubsub&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>